T1 waits for lock B, held by T2
T2 waits for lock C, held by T3
T3 waits for lock A, held by T1
T4 waits for lock A, held by T1
from T1: T1 -> T2 -> T3 -> T1  (back to the start: CYCLE)
from T2: T2 -> T3 -> T1 -> T2  (back to the start: CYCLE)
from T3: T3 -> T1 -> T2 -> T3  (back to the start: CYCLE)
from T4: T4 -> T1 -> T2 -> T3 -> T1  (not in the cycle, but waits on it)
